abstract: >-
  memkern is the domain-agnostic numerical core of the Hope 'n Mind
  Scientific Suite. It provides a Matrix-Pencil Prony decomposition of
  exponential sums together with a novel MaxEnt-based order selector
  ("maxent_select_order"), a principled alternative to variance-ratio
  truncation. The same primitives apply across physics (bath correlation
  functions), rheology (Maxwell-Wiechert relaxation modulus), climate
  (impulse response functions), biology (calcium integration, gene
  regulation with translation lag), and general time-series analysis.
